//! Lynx Loader
//!
//! Loader stubs for the Atari Lynx. Ported from the HLAKit Lynx examples.
//!
//! Target triplet: `mos65sc02-atari-lynx`

// --- micro loader ----------------------------------------------------------
//
// The micro loader is the bare minimum encrypted first-stage loader. It
// sets up system registers and loads the secondary loader into the top of
// RAM. The Lynx RSA public key encrypts this code.

// TODO: populate with micro loader logic ported from
// ../hlakit/examples/6502/lynx/micro_loader.s

// --- secondary loader ------------------------------------------------------
//
// The secondary loader loads the main game executable into RAM and then
// jumps to it. The micro loader loads this code into the top of RAM.

